The native C updater statically links musl, LLVM compiler-rt builtins, libcurl,
Mbed TLS, zlib and cJSON. Their license files are included in this directory.
Pinned source URLs and SHA256 checksums are maintained in
Dashborne/dashborne/updater/dependencies.json.

Its embedded Mozilla root certificate bundle (roots.pem) was retrieved from
https://curl.se/ca/cacert.pem on 2026-11-25 and is distributed under MPL-2.0.
Certificate bundle source: https://curl.se/docs/caextract.html.
